ion style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: stretch;height: auto;background-color: rgb(255, 248, 246);padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 60px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" margin-top: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">新进来的朋友<span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">点击上方蓝色字体关注我</strong></span>，可以第一时间获取我的市场观点及操作策略。</p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">今天还是放量，这么大的量但是没怎么涨，回一下的概率还是很大的，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">我判断就是类似下图</strong>，但是中间可能还有一些细节不一样，我们做好这个准备就行了。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6437008\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMO5s3nWv7MiaHBiaKnQ8esCogwRgmdSN39TM3IogmmPmASX6iciaYqyCJRLRvJ2UDN6W5W5VBegnIw4zQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1016\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">但是操作上，长线被套的就放那别动了，或者只拿一部分仓位做个差价，不规避这个回调，别真的小概率拉起来了，在这么大的底部踏空行情因小失大。在这种低位，我底仓肯定是不动，要拿大行情的。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">最近板块上也有分化，中小盘都表现不怎么好，低估值大盘股又涨起来了，这也是按我们的技术面在走，因为中证1000到了阻力位。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5416667\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMO5s3nWv7MiaHBiaKnQ8esCogXHIJUuY576bljxuqcH6IkX9D1S5h59p0iaicZl7dMckjial9IGbPQcbibA/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">包括中概、腾讯等等都是从颈线涨起来的，上周四也都提示了。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">所以别在我们的技术失效的时候失去信心，想想准的时候，做交易就是做概率，赚钱就是把高概率的事情不断重复。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">我曾经无数个日夜复盘总结，也用这套技术赚过多少次大钱，再结合股债利差等判断顶底的基本面指标，分散配置的基础上基本可以做到万无一失，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">相信我，相信这套技术，多去复盘</strong>。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">板块上，低估值的量价关系还算匹配，暂时看都没什么问题，就怕那种突然放巨量的。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">银行保险券商红利等等都是温和放量，中阳线是我们最希望的，真的有可能从这个位置起飞一波行情。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(246, 8, 8);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">但是地产可能要回一回了</strong></span>，昨天又出了重磅消息，16条政策支持房地产企业，尤其是小企业融资，这次的支持力度是最近几年最强的一次。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4346549\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMO5s3nWv7MiaHBiaKnQ8esCogjaKGshxsmxyjae22noM70jW6VPlWDNdMwExTZyr79fYric5VjUpY7nQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"681\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">这也又印证了我们上周说有传闻地产要出政策，结果传闻果然是真的，如果那个时候布局，正好是低点附近。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">不过地产今天的量就有点太大了，先看看收盘的情况，如果有利润的，那么就真的可以先减仓甚至先出掉了。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0168712\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMO5s3nWv7MiaHBiaKnQ8esCog80USibpWyiagyGZzDDcu5H6v4BoMEdHYBfIOotchFVw3vogvspPwLHMw/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"652\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">现在中证1000、光伏等板块的回调也马上打到支撑了，等到位可能还会出现大小盘风格的再次切换，到时候我再提醒大家。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">该来的总会来的！</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" align-items: center;display: flex;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 1 0 1px;letter-spacing: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" margin-top: 0.5em;margin-bottom: 0.5em; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 0 1 auto;box-shadow: rgb(0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;padding-right: 5px;padding-left: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"  transform: rotateZ(45deg);-webkit-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-moz-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-o-transform: rotateZ(45deg);box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\" text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 10px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;background-color: rgb(255, 222, 23);border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62);box-shadow: rgb(255, 255, 255) 1px 1px 0px inset;line-height: 0;letter-spacing: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: 